Breaks: secubox-mmpm (<< 1.1)
Replaces: secubox-mmpm (<< 1.1)
Description: SecuBox MagicMirror management
 Smart display platform management for SecuBox.
 Provides API and web UI for MagicMirror² configuration,
 module management, and display controls.
 .
 As of 1.1, the MagicMirror Package Manager (MMPM) frontend and
 endpoints are folded into this package and reachable at
 /magicmirror/mmpm/ and /api/v1/magicmirror/mmpm/* respectively.
 The standalone secubox-mmpm package is now a transitional shell
 and can be removed via apt autoremove after upgrade.
